Package: gnukebox
Version: @VERSION@
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: thetech207 <https://github.com/thetech207/GNUkeBox>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.8),
         python3-pyqt5,
         python3-pyqt5.qtmultimedia,
         python3-mutagen,
         libqt5multimedia5-plugins,
         gstreamer1.0-plugins-good,
         gstreamer1.0-plugins-ugly,
         gstreamer1.0-libav,
         gstreamer1.0-pulseaudio | gstreamer1.0-alsa
Homepage: https://github.com/thetech207/GNUkeBox
Description: search-driven jukebox for large music collections
 A PyQt5 + GStreamer music player. It indexes your music folders into a
 SQLite library (ID3v1/v2, Vorbis/FLAC, MP4 and WMA tags), lets you build
 playlists by typing into tag fields (title, artist, album, year, genre,
 track, comment), and plays unattended — at playlist end it continues
 with tracks sharing the artists/genres you searched for. Includes a
 full-screen now-playing view and a dark theme.
 .
 Plays MP3, FLAC, Ogg/Vorbis, Opus, M4A/AAC, WAV, WMA and more through
 GStreamer.
